				<r3d:description language="eng">Project Tycho is a repository for global health, particularly disease surveillance data. Project Tycho currently includes data for 92 notifiable disease conditions in the US, and up to three dengue-related conditions for 99 countries. Project Tycho has compiled data from reputable sources such as the US Centers for Disease Control, the World Health Organization, and National health agencies for countries around the world. Project Tycho datasets are highly standardized and have rich metadata to improve access, interoperability, and reuse of global health data for research and innovation.</r3d:description>
